{
  "name": "WF4 — Follow-up Scheduler (Template-based, no Claude)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\n// ============================================================\n// FOLLOW-UP TEMPLATES — NO CLAUDE CALL\n// 3 attempts × 2 languages = 6 templates\n// Injected variables: first_name, area, avg_sale_price/avg_rent\n// Language from owner.language (set by regex in WF3)\n// ============================================================\n\nconst owner = $('Get overdue owners').item.json;\nconst firstName = (owner.owner_name || 'there').split(' ')[0];\nconst area = owner.area || 'Dubai';\nconst lang = owner.language || 'en';\nconst attempt = (owner.follow_up_count || 0) + 1;\nconst txType = (owner.transaction_type || 'sale').toLowerCase();\nconst isArabic = lang === 'ar';\n\n// Load most recent message for context\nconst recentMsgs = $('Load recent messages').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst lastAgentMsg = recentMsgs.find(m => m.sender === 'agent')?.content || '';\n\n// ---- ATTEMPT 1: Warm check-in — assume they were busy ----\nconst attempt1 = {\n  en: `Hey ${firstName} — just wanted to check if you had a chance to look into this. No rush at all, whenever suits you.`,\n  ar: `هلا ${firstName} — بس أتحقق إذا عندك فرصة تطلع على الموضوع. ما في ضغط، وقتك مناسب.`\n};\n\n// ---- ATTEMPT 2: Market insight angle — add urgency ----\nconst attempt2 = {\n  en: `${firstName}, quick update — we've had strong enquiry activity in ${area} this week. ${txType === 'rental' ? 'Rental demand is up.' : 'Buyer interest is high right now.'} Just wanted to keep you in the loop in case timing matters.`,\n  ar: `${firstName}، تحديث سريع — عندنا اهتمام قوي بمنطقة ${area} هذا الأسبوع. ${txType === 'rental' ? 'الطلب على الإيجار مرتفع.' : 'المشترين جادين الحين.'} أردت أعلمك في حال الوقت مهم.`\n};\n\n// ---- ATTEMPT 3: Graceful exit — leave door open ----\nconst attempt3 = {\n  en: `No worries at all ${firstName} — I completely understand timing isn't always right. If anything changes or you'd like to revisit this, you know where I am. Take care!`,\n  ar: `لا مشكلة إطلاقاً ${firstName} — أفهم تماماً إن الوقت مو دايماً مناسب. لو تغير شيء أو أردت نتكلم مرة ثانية، أنا هنا. تسلم!`\n};\n\nconst templates = { 1: attempt1, 2: attempt2, 3: attempt3 };\nconst selected = templates[Math.min(attempt, 3)];\nconst messageText = isArabic ? selected.ar : selected.en;\nconst isFinal = attempt >= 3;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    message_text: messageText,\n    owner_id: owner.id,\n    conversation_id: owner.conversation_id,\n    phone_wa: owner.phone_wa,\n    chat_id: owner.telegram_id,\n    owner_name: owner.owner_name,\n    attempt_number: attempt,\n    is_final: isFinal,\n    new_status: isFinal ? 'stalled' : 'waiting_reply'\n  }\n}];\n"
      },
      "name": "Code — follow-up template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "id": "df7c0ffe-3ecb-4d1d-985c-500af383886f",
      "notes": "Zero Claude calls. 6 templates hardcoded (3 attempts x EN/AR). Language read from owner.language set by WF3's regex detector. Attempt 3 sets status to stalled."
    },
